rements of the product and to provide solid context for others working on the product. You should include:\n\nProject overview / description\nTarget audience\nPrimary benefits / features\nHigh-level tech/architecture used\nKeep the brief very concise and to the point just to give enough context to understand the bigger picture. Write the document into docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.md (unless a different file name is specified)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:17:46.192Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring concise product brief creation for projects involving Expo and NextJS","zh":"适用于需要为涉及 Expo 和 NextJS 的项目创建简洁产品简介的开发代理","ja":"Expo と NextJS を使用したプロジェクトの簡潔な製品ブリーフを作成するために開発エージェントが必要とするものに適しています","ko":"Expo와 NextJS를 사용하는 프로젝트에 대한 간결한 제품 개요を作成해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren una creación concisa de descripciones de productos para proyectos que involucran Expo y NextJS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une création concise de descriptions de produits pour les projets impliquant Expo et NextJS","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine präzise Erstellung von Produktbeschreibungen für Projekte mit Expo und NextJS erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem a criação concisa de briefs de produto para projetos que envolvem Expo e NextJS","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих краткого создания описания продукта для проектов, включающих Expo и NextJS","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب إنشاء وصف منتج متكامل لمشاريع تتضمن Expo و NextJS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture business and functional requirements using monorepo templates, incorporating project overviews, target audience analysis, and high-level tech architecture, all within a concise document format like docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF","zh":"赋予代理商使用 monorepo 模板捕获业务和功能需求的能力，包括项目概述、目标受众分析和高级技术架构，都在像 docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF 这样的简洁文档格式中","ja":"monorepo テンプレートを使用してビジネス要件と機能要件を把握するエージェント