zados","Integração com autoridades fiscais do país","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivo","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Segurança de dados avançada"],"ru":["Генерация индивидуальных налоговых отчетов","Интеграция с налоговыми органами страны","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя","Продвинутая безопасность данных"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير ضريبية مخصصة","التكامل مع سلطات الضرائب في البلد","دعم صيغ ملفات متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام","أمان بيانات متقدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI工具生成税务报告","什么是infoproviders-lookup-data","infoproviders-lookup-data替代工具","infoproviders-lookup-data安装指南","税务报告生成工具","AI工具在税务报告中的应用"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用して税金レポートを生成する方法","infoproviders-lookup-dataとは","infoproviders-lookup-dataの代替ツール","infoproviders-lookup-dataのインストールガイド","税金レポート生成ツール","AIエージェントの税金レポートへの応用"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용하여 세금 보고서를 생성하는 방법","infoproviders-lookup-data란","infoproviders-lookup-data의 대체 도구","infoproviders-lookup-data 설치 가이드","세금 보고서 생성 도구","AI 에이전트의 세금 보고서への 적용"],"es":["herramientas de AI para impuestos","informes de impuestos de corretaje","cómo generar informes de impuestos","alternativas a infoproviders-lookup-data","infoproviders-lookup-data vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de infoproviders-lookup-data","guía de configuración de infoproviders-lookup-data"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les taxes","rapports de taxes de courtage","comment générer des rapports de taxes","alternatives à infoproviders-lookup-data","infoproviders-lookup-data vs autres outils d''IA","installation de infoproviders-lookup-data","guide de configuration de infoproviders-lookup-data"],"de":["KI-Tools für Steuern","Steuererklärungen für Wertpapierkonten","wie man Steuererklärungen erstellt","Alternativen zu infoproviders-lookup-data","infoproviders-lookup-data vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von infoproviders-lookup-data","Einrichtungsanleitung für infoproviders-lookup-data"],"pt":["ferramentas de AI para impostos","como usar Infoproviders Lookup Data","o que é Infoproviders Lookup Data","alternativas para Infoproviders Lookup Data","Instalação do Infoproviders Lookup Data","guia de configuração do Infoproviders Lookup Data"],"ru":["ИИ инструменты для налогов","как использовать Инфопровайдеры Lookup Data","что такое Инфопровайдеры Lookup Data","альтернативы для Инфопровайдеры Lookup Data","Установка Инфопровайдеры Lookup Data","руководство по настройке Инфопровайдеры Lookup Data"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للضريبة","كيفية استخدام أداة بحث بيانات Infoproviders","ما هي أداة بحث بيانات Infoproviders","بديلات لأداة بحث بيانات Infoproviders","تثبيت أداة بحث بيانات Infoproviders","دليل إعداد أداة بحث بيانات Infoproviders"]}},"owner":"MarjanDB","repo":"brrr-generator","repoPath":"MarjanDB/brrr-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.046Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"infoproviders-lookup-data","description":"When and how to edit InfoProviders lookup JSONs (company, country, treaty, ISIN). Use when fixing Failed processing stock lot, wrong country or company data, or adding fallbacks for unresolved identifiers.","bodyPreview":"# InfoProviders and lookup data\n\nGeneric guidance for `src/InfoProviders/` and the JSON lookup files. Country-specific use (e.g. treaty format) may be documented in a tax-authority skill.\n\n## Where lookups are used\n\n- **CompanyLookupProvider** – Resolves ISIN to company info (name, address, country). Tries online lookup first; falls back to **missingCompaniesLookup.json** and **missingISINLookup.json**.\n- **CountryLookupProvider** – Resolves country name to 2-letter code and treaty info. Uses **","body":"# InfoProviders and lookup data\n\nGeneric guidance for `src/InfoProviders/` and the JSON lookup files. Country-specific use (e.g. treaty format) may be documented in a tax-authority skill.\n\n## Where lookups are used\n\n- **CompanyLookupProvider** – Resolves ISIN to company info (name, address, country). Tries online lookup first; falls back to **missingCompaniesLookup.json** and **missingISINLookup.json**.\n- **CountryLookupProvider** – Resolves country name to 2-letter code and treaty info. Uses **internationalTreaties.json** and **specialCountryMappings.json**.\n\nTax authority report generation and staging processors use these when annotating events (e.g. company domicile, treaty relief).\n\n## When to edit which file\n\n| Symptom                                                      | Likely fix                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **\"Failed processing stock lot\"** or \"Failed lookup of ISIN\" | Lot or event has an identifier (ISIN/ticker) the pipeline can’t resolve. Add or correct an entry in **missingISINLookup.json** (ISIN → ticker for online lookup) or **missingCompaniesLookup.json** (ISIN → full company object for offline fallback). |\n| Wrong or missing **company** name/address                    | Add or update entry in **missingCompaniesLookup.json** for that identifier (e.g. ISIN).                                                                                                                                                                |\n| Online lookup fails for a known ISIN/ticker                  | Add **missingISINLookup.json** entry: key = ISIN, value = ticker symbol used by the lookup service (e.g. for yfinance).                                                                                                                                |\n| Wrong **country** code or unknown country name               | Add or update **specialCountryMappings.json**: key = country name as in broker/data, value = 2-letter ISO code.                                                                                                                                        |\n| **Treaty** reference (e.g. tax relief) for a country         | Add or update **internationalTreaties.json** under the structure used by CountryLookupProvider (e.g. treaties by country code). Exact key/value format is defined by the tax authority; see country-specific skill if applicable.                      |\n\n## File formats (generic)\n\n- **missingISINLookup.json** – Object: identifier (e.g. ISIN) → string (e.g. ticker). Used when resolution by identifier fails so the provider can try again with the mapped value.\n- **missingCompaniesLookup.json** – Object: identifier (e.g. ISIN) → company object. Company object typically has fields such as shortName, longName, address1, address2, city, zip, country (and optionally state). Used when no online company data is available.\n- **specialCountryMappings.json** – Object: country name (as in data) → 2-letter country code. Overrides default country resolution.\n- **internationalTreaties.json** – Nested structure (e.g. treaties.taxRelief) keyed by country code; values are treaty references. Structure and semantics depend on the tax authority; see country skill for details.\n\nAll paths are under `src/InfoProviders/`. After editing, re-run the pipeline; no separate reload step is required.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:24:12.402Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced tax report generation with accurate company and country lookup data.","zh":"适合需要高级税务报告生成和准确公司及国家查找数据的金融分析代理","ja":"金融分析エージェントが高度な税務報告書の生成と正確な会社および国別の検索データを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 세금 보고서 생성 및 정확한 회사 및 국가 조회 데이터가 필요한 재무 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced tax report generation with accurate company and country lookup data.","fr":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced tax report generation with accurate company and country lookup data.","de":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced tax report generation with accurate company and country lookup data.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que necessitam de geração avançada de relatórios de impostos com dados de lookup de empresa e país precisos.","ru":"Идеально для финансовых аналитических агентов, которым необходима расширенная генерация налоговых отчетов с точными данными поиска компании и страны.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليليين الماليين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تقارير ضريبية متقدمة مع بيانات بحث دقيقة للشركة والبلد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to resolve ISIN to company information and country names to 2-letter codes and treaty info using JSON lookup files, such as missingCompaniesLookup.json and missingISINLookup.json, enhancing their tax reporting capabilities with precise data validation and online lookup fallbacks.","zh":"赋予代理人使用JSON查找文件（如missingCompaniesLookup.json和missingISINLookup.json）解析ISIN到公司信息和国家名称到2字母代码及条约信息的能力，从而增强他们的税务报告能力，具有精确的数据验证和在线查找的备份","ja":"エージェントにJSONルックアップファイル（例：missingCompaniesLookup.jsonおよびmissingISINLookup.json）を使用してISINを会社情報に、国名を2文字コードおよび条約情報に解決する能力を与え、オンラインルックアップのフォールバックを備えた精密なデータ検証により税務報告機能を強化","ko":"에이전트가 JSON 조회 파일(예: missingCompaniesLookup.json 및 missingISINLookup.json)을 사용하여 ISIN을 회사 정보로, 국가 이름을 2자리 코드 및 조약 정보로 해결할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여, 온라인 조회의 백업을 갖춘 정밀한 데이터 검증으로 세금 보고 기능을 강화","es":"Empowers agents to resolve ISIN to company information and country names to 2-letter codes and treaty info using JSON lookup files, such as missingCompaniesLookup.json and missingISINLookup.json, enhancing their tax reporting capabilities with precise data validation and online lookup fallbacks.","fr":"Empowers agents to resolve ISIN to company information and country names to 2-letter codes and treaty info using JSON lookup files, such as missingCompaniesLookup.json and missingISINLookup.json, enhancing their tax reporting capabilities with precise data validation and online lookup fallbacks.","de":"Empowers agents to resolve ISIN to company information and country names to 2-letter codes and treaty info using JSON lookup files, such as missingCompaniesLookup.json and missingISINLookup.json, enhancing their tax reporting capabilities with precise data validation and online lookup fallbacks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver ISIN para informações de empresa e nomes de país para códigos de 2 letras e informações de tratado usando arquivos de lookup JSON, como missingCompaniesLookup.json e missingISINLookup.json, melhorando suas capacidades de relatórios de impostos com validação de dados precisa e fallbacks de lookup online.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью решать ISIN для информации о компании и названиях стран для 2-буквенных кодов и информации о договоре, используя файлы JSON-lookup, такие как missingCompaniesLookup.json и missingISINLookup.json, повышая их возможности налогового отчетности с точной проверкой данных и онлайн-lookup fallbacks.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء حل ISIN لمعلومات الشركة وأسماء البلدان إلى رموز مكونة من حرفين ومعلومات المعاهدة باستخدام ملفات JSON للبحث ، مثل missingCompaniesLookup.json و missingISINLookup.json ، وتحسين قدراتهم على تقارير الضرائب مع التحقق من صحة البيانات الدقيقة وallbacks للبحث عبر الإنترنت."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating tax reports for brokerage accounts with accurate company details","Resolving country names to 2-letter codes for treaty format compliance","Validating company information against online lookup services and JSON files"],"zh":["为券商账户生成税务报告，包含准确的公司详细信息","将国家名称解析为2字母代码，以满足条约格式的要求","验证公司信息与在线查找服务及JSON文件"],"ja":["ブローカー口座の税務報告書を生成し、正確な会社の詳細情報を含む","国名を2文字コードに解決して条約形式の要件を満たす","会社情報をオンライン検索サービスおよびJSONファイルと検証"],"ko":["중개인 계좌의 세금 보고서 생성, 정확한 회사詳細 정보 포함","국가 이름을 2자리 코드로 해결하여 조약 형식의 요구 사항을 충족","회사 정보를 온라인 조회 서비스 및 JSON 파일과 검증"],"es":["Generating tax reports for brokerage accounts with accurate company details","Resolving country names to 2-letter codes for treaty format compliance","Validating company information against online lookup services and JSON files"],"fr":["Generating tax reports for brokerage accounts with accurate company details","Resolving country names to 2-letter codes for treaty format compliance","Validating company information against online lookup services and JSON files"],"de":["Generating tax reports for brokerage accounts with accurate company details","Resolving country names to 2-letter codes for treaty format compliance","Validating company information against online lookup services and JSON files"],"pt":["Gerar relatórios de impostos para contas de corretagem com detalhes de empresa precisos","Resolver nomes de país para códigos de 2 letras para conformidade com o formato de tratado","Validar informações de empresa contra serviços de lookup online e arquivos JSON"],"ru":["Генерировать налоговые отчеты для брокерских счетов с точными данными о компании","Решать названия стран для 2-буквенных кодов для соответствия формату договора","Проверять информацию о компании против онлайн-сервисов lookup и файлов JSON"],"ar":["توليد تقارير ضريبية لحسابات الوساطة مع تفاصيل دقيقة للشركة","حل أسماء البلدان إلى رموز مكونة من حرفين للامتثال لتنسيق المعاهدة","التحقق من صحة معلومات الشركة مقابل خدمات البحث عبر الإنترنت وملفات JSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to online lookup services for company and country data","Dependent on the accuracy of JSON lookup files, such as missingCompaniesLookup.json and missingISINLookup.json"],"zh":["需要访问在线查找服务以获取公司及国家数据","依赖于JSON查找文件（如missingCompaniesLookup.json和missingISINLookup.json）的准确性"],"ja":["会社および国別のデータを取得するためにオンラインルックアップサービスへのアクセスが必要","missingCompaniesLookup.jsonおよびmissingISINLookup.jsonなどのJSONルックアップファイルの正確性に依存"],"ko":["회사 및 국가 데이터를 얻기 위해 온라인 조회 서비스에 접근할 필요가 있음","missingCompaniesLookup.json 및 missingISINLookup.json 등의 JSON 조회 파일의 정확성에 의존